## Model card

- **Name:** Claude Sonnet 5
- **Short description:** Anthropic's most capable Sonnet-class model, built for the agentic era with adaptive thinking and 1M context at a lower cost than Opus.
- **Provider / access:** OpenCode Zen `anthropic/claude-sonnet-5` — see meta.json
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026 per vendor docs; knowledge cutoff 2026-03
- **IDs:** `anthropic/claude-sonnet-5`
- **Context window:** 1M / 128K out
- **Modalities:** Text, image, file in; text out
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-23):** Paid $5/$25 per 1M (1M /128K out) — note: Paid $3/$15 per 1M (no Zen Free ID)
- **Architecture:** Proprietary

