### Normalized scores (1–100)

- **Tool use: 88/100.** Evidence Terminal-Bench ~80.4%; capped by missing Claw-Eval/Tau3 isolation.
- **Reasoning: 86/100.** Evidence GPQA ~80%, HLE 57.4%; capped by incomplete HLE/MRCR.
- **Context window: 96/100.** 1M / 128K out — tiered per methodology (≥1M=95-100, 200K=70, 256K≈72).
- **Multimodal: 70/100.** Text, image, file in; text out; scored per multimodal rubric (text-only 15, image 60-70, video/PDF 75-90, audio-in 90-100).
- **Coding: 87/100.** Evidence SWE-bench Pro 63.2%; capped by missing isolated LiveCode/SciCode where noted.
- **Cost efficiency: 55/100.** Paid $5/$25 per 1M (1M /128K out).
- **Overall Score: 85/100.** Mean of five non-cost dims (88+86+96+70+87)/5=85.4 → 85; best-fit per scoring methodology.

